          "source_text_sha256": "04fa8188109d9092c40731d9a4a7b7e6373cc1a1fb542b9932721e93a2073a25",
          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Observation of a bright point moving at a steady speed and on a curved trajectory in the sky: observation of the International Space Station (ISS).",
